        "text": "={{ 'Question: ' + $('Build Grounded CRM Prompt').item.json.question + String.fromCharCode(10,10) + 'Answer: ' + $('Generate AI Answer').item.json.text + String.fromCharCode(10,10) + 'Decide if this exchange reveals a durable fact, preference, correction, outcome, or pattern about this CRM workspace worth remembering for future conversations. Do NOT save generic CRM data already stored in the database (lead counts, names, dates) — only save workspace-level knowledge not already an explicit CRM field. If nothing durable was learned, set should_save to false.' + String.fromCharCode(10,10) + 'Respond with ONLY a JSON object, no markdown, no code fences, in this exact shape: {\"should_save\": boolean, \"memory_type\": \"fact\"|\"preference\"|\"correction\"|\"outcome\"|\"pattern\", \"content\": string, \"confidence\": number between 0 and 1}' }}",
        "batching": {}
